sequenceDiagram
    actor Aud as Auditor
    participant Web as Next.js App<br/>(/auditor)
    participant API as Typed API Client<br/>(auditorApi)
    participant Mock as MSW Handler<br/>(auditor.ts)
    participant DB as Mock DB + Scheduler

    Aud->>Web: Open queue, sort by newest/deadline/bounty
    Web->>API: listQueue({sort})
    API->>Mock: GET /api/auditor/queue?sort=...
    Mock->>DB: listQueue() (Open contracts only)
    DB-->>Mock: QueueItem[]
    Mock-->>API: 200 QueueItem[]
    API-->>Web: QueueItem[]

    Aud->>Web: Click "Claim"
    Web->>API: claimContract(contractId, auditorId)
    API->>Mock: POST /api/auditor/claim
    alt contract still Open
        Mock->>DB: claimContract()
        DB->>DB: Contract.status = Claimed<br/>Finding.claimedByAuditorId/claimExpiresAt set (+10 min)
        DB-->>Mock: Contract
        Mock-->>API: 200 Contract
        Web->>Aud: Show live claim-expiry countdown
    else already claimed
        Mock-->>API: 409 Conflict
        API-->>Web: ApiError(409)
        Web->>Aud: "Already claimed" message, refresh queue
    end

    Aud->>Web: Post stake (gate requires stake >= REQUIRED_STAKE)
    Web->>API: postStake(auditorId, amount)
    API->>Mock: POST /api/auditor/stake
    Mock->>DB: postStake()
    DB-->>Mock: AuditorProfile (stake updated)
    Mock-->>API: 200 AuditorProfile
    API-->>Web: Unlock PoC upload UI

    Aud->>Web: Upload PoC (.t.sol) for a Flagged finding
    Web->>API: submitPoc(findingId, auditorId, file)
    API->>Mock: POST /api/auditor/poc (multipart FormData)
    Mock->>DB: submitPoc()
    DB->>DB: Create PoCSubmission (sandboxStatus=Pending)<br/>Finding.status = Submitted
    DB->>DB: scheduleOnce("sandbox:<pocId>", ~3s)
    DB-->>Mock: PoCSubmission
    Mock-->>API: 201 PoCSubmission
    API-->>Web: Finding now Submitted (UI hides re-submit)

    Note over Web,DB: Web polls findings every 2s

    DB->>DB: Timer fires: resolveSandbox()
    alt PoC reproduces the exploit
        DB->>DB: PoCSubmission.sandboxStatus = Passed<br/>Finding.status = Verified<br/>armChallengeWindow() -> challengeWindowExpiresAt = now+30s
    else PoC fails to reproduce (seeded failing case)
        DB->>DB: PoCSubmission.sandboxStatus = Failed<br/>Finding.status = Rejected
    end

    Web->>API: listFindings(contractId)
    API->>Mock: GET /api/contracts/:id/findings
    Mock-->>API: 200 Finding[] (Verified or Rejected)
    API-->>Web: Updated findings
    Web->>Aud: Show new status live
